# .github/CODEOWNERS
# Who reviews changes to each part of Bazaar (Chapter 22). On GitHub, the
# last matching line wins, so general lines come first. boundary_check
# fails when a package has no line of its own or a line names no package.

# Anything not listed below, including CI files and the root pubspec.
*                           @your-org/architecture

# The apps: each one a composition root (Chapter 23: the kiosk).
/apps/bazaar_app/           @your-org/app-platform
/apps/kiosk/                @your-org/retail-stores

# Each module team owns its contract and its implementation.
/modules/identity/          @your-org/accounts
/modules/identity_api/      @your-org/accounts
/modules/catalog/           @your-org/catalog
/modules/catalog_api/       @your-org/catalog
/modules/cart/              @your-org/checkout-experience
/modules/cart_api/          @your-org/checkout-experience
/modules/checkout/          @your-org/checkout-experience
/modules/checkout_api/      @your-org/checkout-experience
/modules/payments/          @your-org/payments
/modules/payments_api/      @your-org/payments
/modules/notifications/     @your-org/engagement

# Shared code changes every module: the architecture group reviews it.
/shared/                    @your-org/architecture
/shared/ui_kit/             @your-org/design-system

# The rules themselves.
/tools/                     @your-org/architecture
